WEBVTT - Subtitles by: Nucleon

20:02.158 --> 20:05.119
on this street, in this house.

20:05.286 --> 20:08.122
A man had come as a last resort,

20:08.289 --> 20:12.789
because... no one else
would go near the place.

20:17.882 --> 20:20.718
I hear you've been expecting me.

20:20.885 --> 20:22.720
- You are the...?
- That's right.

20:22.887 --> 20:24.388
I am...

20:25.265 --> 20:27.392
...the babysitter.

20:27.559 --> 20:29.310
Yes, yes.
Thank goodness that you've come.

20:33.440 --> 20:35.567
My boy. I don't know
what's gotten into him.

20:35.734 --> 20:36.985
I've never seen anything like it.

20:37.152 --> 20:39.654
Trust me, buddy, I've got
three little ogres at home.

20:39.821 --> 20:41.614
This will be a piece of cake.

20:41.781 --> 20:43.908
Father.

20:47.287 --> 20:48.496
Father!

20:48.663 --> 20:51.499
- OK, then.
- Look, I'm telling you.

20:51.666 --> 20:53.876
I've tried every trick in the book.
You see?

20:54.043 --> 20:57.254
"Once Upon A Time-Out"?
Oh, come on, now.

20:57.422 --> 21:00.299
- You're gonna listen to a goose?
- Please. You don't understand.

21:00.467 --> 21:01.759
It's like he's two different people.

21:01.926 --> 21:06.180
What your kid needs is discipline, not
a bunch of psychological mumbo jumbo.

21:06.347 --> 21:09.308
You just gotta walk in there,
look him in the eye,

21:09.476 --> 21:10.935
and show him who's...

21:13.938 --> 21:16.190
Please tell me he's an only child.

21:16.357 --> 21:18.150
Bubblegum fish pants...

21:19.152 --> 21:20.194
Hello.

21:22.155 --> 21:23.614
Well, here's your problem.

21:23.782 --> 21:25.658
His head's not screwed on right.

21:25.825 --> 21:27.952
When you wish upon a star,

21:28.119 --> 21:30.329
you get lots of stuff.

21:30.497 --> 21:32.707
Well, I wish for a nice, quiet evening

21:32.874 --> 21:35.376
where you go to sleep
and I raid the icebox.

21:35.543 --> 21:36.585
OK.

21:42.217 --> 21:44.594
See? That was easy.

21:44.761 --> 21:47.472
It's like I always say,
when it comes to good parenting,

21:47.639 --> 21:49.390
you have to be fair but firm.

21:49.557 --> 21:52.059
You just show 'em
that you mean business...

21:52.227 --> 21:53.853
And he's out of bed again, isn't he?

21:56.731 --> 21:58.983
You never have this problem
with sock puppets.

22:00.860 --> 22:02.570
All right, what's this all about?

22:02.737 --> 22:03.904
Voices.

22:04.072 --> 22:07.033
- Voices?
- In here.

22:07.200 --> 22:10.077
Telling me what to do.

22:10.245 --> 22:13.414
You have voices inside your head.

22:13.581 --> 22:15.082
Sometimes.

22:15.250 --> 22:18.962
And what kind of things
do they tell you to do?

22:25.426 --> 22:26.760
The early bird catches the worms!

22:26.928 --> 22:28.429
What's gotten into this kid?

22:28.596 --> 22:30.097
Hey! You're going to...

22:30.265 --> 22:32.267
Maybe you sing him a little song.

22:32.433 --> 22:34.268
Come here, you... Hey!
What the...?

22:34.435 --> 22:37.563
Do I look like the kind of guy
that knows a lullaby?

22:37.730 --> 22:38.689
Sing!

22:38.857 --> 22:40.942
Lullaby and good night

22:41.109 --> 22:44.195
Close your big creepy eyes

22:44.362 --> 22:47.365
If you sleep
Away [I'll creep

22:47.532 --> 22:51.702
And get out of here alive

22:52.829 --> 22:56.123
You know, once you get past
all the splinters and rope burns,

22:56.291 --> 22:58.251
he's actually kind of cute.

22:59.043 --> 23:00.878
Now where did he go?

23:02.255 --> 23:06.755
A bird in the hand is worth
two in the bush.

23:07.302 --> 23:09.971
Now there's something
you don't see every day.

23:10.555 --> 23:12.807
Get him off! Get him off!

23:21.608 --> 23:23.318
Come back here, you!

23:23.484 --> 23:25.861
I regret nothing!

23:41.794 --> 23:43.837
I'm too young to have termites!

23:44.005 --> 23:46.674
I'm no termite, Pinocchio.
I'm a cricket.

23:46.841 --> 23:50.135
You were the voice in my head
this whole time?

23:50.303 --> 23:51.304
That's right.

23:51.471 --> 23:54.182
I'm the one who was putting
all those thoughts in your noggin.

23:54.349 --> 23:56.476
I'm your conscience,
and as long as you let me,

23:56.643 --> 23:57.977
I'll always be your...

24:01.981 --> 24:03.899
The end.

24:04.901 --> 24:08.696
That wasn't me.
I never had any bugs in my head.

24:08.863 --> 24:09.947
Ask anyone.

24:10.114 --> 24:13.325
OK, then. Why don't we start
by asking your conscience.